# UX workflow: child-content edit undo/redo keeps the published UI readable.
# Purpose: validates that a micro-sequence edit can be undone and redone from
# the normal global history path after its retained editor has been closed.
# Expect: capture_changed:micro_note_offset_applied=micro_note_offset_undone_ui, capture_match:micro_note_offset_applied=micro_note_offset_redone_ui

0 scenario sequencer
50 capture screen sequencer_ready

# Enable root step 1, open Step Edit, and enter Micro-sequence.
150 tap MACRO_1 60
320 capture screen root_step_enabled
420 button MACRO_1 down
1480 tick
1540 capture screen root_step_edit_open
1600 button MACRO_1 up
1700 encoder NAV 1
1780 encoder NAV 1
1860 encoder NAV 1
1940 encoder NAV 1
2020 encoder NAV 1
2100 encoder NAV 1
2180 encoder NAV 1
2260 capture screen micro_row_focused
2360 tap NAV 60
2660 capture screen micro_context_open

# Edit micro step 1 note offset, then apply.
2760 button MACRO_1 down
3820 tick
3880 capture screen micro_step_edit_open
3940 button MACRO_1 up
4040 encoder NAV 1
4100 encoder NAV 1
4180 encoder OPT 0.72
4360 capture screen micro_step_note_offset_visible
4460 tap NAV 60
4760 capture screen micro_note_offset_preview

# Publish the complete Micro draft before exercising project history. This is
# one history entry; child edits are no longer leaked while authoring. Publish
# first returns to the root Step Editor. A second Back closes that editor;
# only the following LEFT_TOP opens global history.
4820 tap BOTTOM_RIGHT 60
5000 tap LEFT_TOP 60
5240 capture screen micro_note_offset_root_editor
5340 tap LEFT_TOP 60
5580 capture screen micro_note_offset_applied

# Undo the published micro edit from the root surface.
5680 tap LEFT_TOP 60
6680 tick
6730 capture screen selector_undo_ready
6780 tap LEFT_CENTER 60
6910 capture screen selector_redo_ready
7010 tap LEFT_TOP 60
8440 capture screen micro_note_offset_undone_ui

# Redo restores the exact published root surface.
8540 tap LEFT_TOP 60
9540 tick
9590 capture screen selector_redo_ready_again
9640 tap LEFT_BOTTOM 60
9770 capture screen selector_undo_restored
9870 tap LEFT_TOP 60
11300 capture screen micro_note_offset_redone_ui
